# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never publish: real internet data, and the code that touches the internet.
# This repo is the harness, specs, prompts, and skill docs only. See README
# "What is deliberately not here".
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Scraped corpora, explorer traces, reconstructed packages, seed DBs.
data/

# The scraper and the functional web explorer. They hit the real internet and
# need per-deployment judgement about robots, terms, and rate limits.
# `skills/site-reconstruct/SKILL.md` documents the input layout they must emit.
tools/scraper/
tools/explorer/
private/

# Raw Claude.ai conversation export (design provenance, kept local).
docs/source-conversation/

